  "descriptionEn": "First archived Berlin source snapshot for lower-secondary mathematics. The snapshot activates the structural Gymnasium anchors for grades 7 to 10 together with the first reviewed functions corridor on mappings and linear functions and the first reviewed algebra-and-equations corridor from the shared Berlin/Brandenburg curriculum.",
